  "description": "The dungeons are a wild place where anything can happen, and they need the best of the best to keep them in check. So when widespread distribution of the aphrodisia-inducing Cherry Bombs begins to run rampant, there is only one man for the job. Captain of Special Forces Team 1, Jeon Jinwoo is known for having the face of a supermodel and the mouth of a sailor…but in order to take down this fruity operation, he’s going to need assemble a team. With the help of his unpredictable subordinate Yoo Haesung and former lover Cha Sera, Jinwoo and squad will have to undergo unthinkable trials and tribulations to restore order to the wild word of the dungeons. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 4 extras.*",
